cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Average information across a network measures what a coordinative
  structure buys in motor control. Code and data.
message: If you use this software or these data, please cite the paper.
type: software
abstract: >-
  Code and derived data behind the paper. A verification gate checks the size
  and hash of every released input, recomputes every value the paper prints,
  and reports 75 of 75 reproducing. No data were collected for this study;
  every measured value comes from a published table or a released file.
